      "content": "SP 81 SE             WESTON TURVILLE         WILLOW END                                              (off Bates Lane) 5/303                                        Nos. 3, 4 & 5 GV                                           II Cottage and former barn (known as Sots Hole) now converted to cottages. C17 timber framed with white painted brick infill to the cottage in the E. bay, renewed white painted weatherboarding to the former barn in the two S.W. bays. Thatched roof, half hipped ends, 2 large projecting dormers to S. side, 3 eaves dormers to N., brick chimney to LH of centre. 2 storeys, C20 doors and leaded casements. RCHM I.p.316.MON.24. Listing NGR: SP8585610684"
    }
